  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Pinned to vouchfx engine ENGINE_PIN v1.4.0. Requires the .NET 10 runtime and the ASP.NET Core 10 shared framework; .NET 8 and 9 are not supported. The pinned CLI is itself a net10.0 build, so it needs no --allow-roll-forward. Updates the MCP SDK to 2.4.0. Eighteen tools, four prompts and eleven resources over stdio or optional bearer-authenticated HTTP. Strictly read-only: it never writes, modifies or deletes a suite file.",
